---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /guides/
title: Companion guides | OpenEduOps
description: Find the OpenEduOps tutorials with companion command guides published as GitHub Gists.
---
{%- set crumbs = [
      { label: "Home", url: "/" },
      { label: "Guides", url: "/guides/" }
    ] %}

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="shell">
    {%- include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <div class="page-head-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-dark">Companion guides</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">The exact commands, next to the tutorial</h1>
      <p class="page-lede">Companion command guides are maintained as GitHub Gists for tutorials
        that need reusable commands. Find the right guide here without hunting for it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title-sm">{{ catalogue.counts.guides }} guides</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">Listed newest first. Guide links open on GitHub Gist; watch links open a
        page here where one exists, and YouTube otherwise.</p>
    </header>

    <ul class="guide-list">
      {%- for tutorial in catalogue.guides %}
        {%- include "components/guide-row.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-sunken section-tight">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2 class="section-title-sm">Looking for the tutorial instead?</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">The catalogue lists all {{ catalogue.counts.total }} published tutorials
      with their outcomes, durations, and environments.</p>
    <p class="cta-row u-mt-6">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tutorials/">Browse all tutorials</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">{{ crumbs | breadcrumbSchema(site.url) | jsonld | safe }}</script>
